Codex baseline capture (spec 067 T009b) — PENDING OPERATOR RUN.

This file is a placeholder. To produce the real
``067_codex_baseline_request.json``, run on a checkout at or before commit
e2a443a (pre-067 wire shape) with ``OPENAI_API_KEY`` set:

  scripts/capture_codex_baseline.py

The capture script intercepts the outbound POST body to
``https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions`` and writes the JSON request
payload here. A representative card from `quickstart.md` Step 4 should be
used.

Until this file exists, ``tests/integration/test_067_codex_unchanged.py``
(T022) skips. The skip is acceptable for the PR; the swap test (T023) and
the structural LCD validator (T011/T018) guarantee correctness in the
meantime.
